abstract: >-
  Research software for ingestion, validation, deduplication, durable storage, roster-based
  summarisation and export of personnel physiological feature records, stationary building-state
  records (including an uncalibrated MQ-2 gas-channel voltage and PIR presence) and source-qualified
  incident events, following the UMSF shared protocol v1.0. Deterministic generators reproduce the
  documented synthetic Study A and Study B results, the Stage-1 bench excerpt and the service
  allocation example of the associated manuscript, and produce a synthetic post-impact incident
  scenario. Strike attribution only from authoritative external sources; no human data included.
  Not a medical device or certified safety system.
